{"route":"/docs/6.0/components/breadcrumb/","version":"6.0","renderedVersion":"6.0","title":{"id":"content","type":"heading","en":"Breadcrumb","level":1},"lead":{"id":"content--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Indicate the current page&#39;s location within a navigational hierarchy using explicit divider elements."},"blocks":[{"id":"example","type":"heading","en":"Example","level":2},{"id":"example--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Use an ordered list with <code>.breadcrumb-item</code> for each page and <code>.breadcrumb-divider</code> elements between them. Leave a divider empty to use the default chevron icon, or add your own separator content. Add <code>.active</code> to the <code>.breadcrumb-link</code> of the current page."},{"id":"example--example-1","type":"demo","key":"64c39141da15fe215653","height":174},{"id":"example--code-1","type":"code","value":"<nav aria-label=\"breadcrumb\">\n  <ol class=\"breadcrumb\">\n    <li class=\"breadcrumb-item\">\n      <a class=\"breadcrumb-link\" href=\"#\">Home</a>\n    </li>\n    <li class=\"breadcrumb-divider\"></li>\n    <li class=\"breadcrumb-item\">\n      <a class=\"breadcrumb-link\" href=\"#\">Library</a>\n    </li>\n    <li class=\"breadcrumb-divider\"></li>\n    <li class=\"breadcrumb-item\" aria-current=\"page\">\n      <a class=\"breadcrumb-link active\" href=\"#\">Data</a>\n    </li>\n  </ol>\n</nav>\n\n<nav aria-label=\"breadcrumb\">\n  <ol class=\"breadcrumb\">\n    <li class=\"breadcrumb-item\">\n      <a class=\"breadcrumb-link\" href=\"#\">Home</a>\n    </li>\n    <li class=\"breadcrumb-divider\"></li>\n    <li class=\"breadcrumb-item\">\n      <a class=\"breadcrumb-link\" href=\"#\">\n        <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" fill=\"currentcolor\"><circle cx=\"2\" cy=\"8\" r=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"8\" cy=\"8\" r=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"8\" r=\"2\"/></svg>\n      </a>\n    </li>\n    <li class=\"breadcrumb-divider\"></li>\n    <li class=\"breadcrumb-item\">\n      <a class=\"breadcrumb-link\" href=\"#\">Documents</a>\n    </li>\n    <li class=\"breadcrumb-divider\"></li>\n    <li class=\"breadcrumb-item\" aria-current=\"page\">\n      <a class=\"breadcrumb-link active\" href=\"#\">2026</a>\n    </li>\n  </ol>\n</nav>","language":""},{"id":"dividers","type":"heading","en":"Dividers","level":2},{"id":"dividers--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Dividers are added explicitly using <code>.breadcrumb-divider</code> elements. An empty divider renders a default chevron, drawn with a CSS <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/customize/sass/#mask-icons\"><code>mask</code></a> so it inherits the divider color (including in dark mode). To use a different separator, add your own content—any SVG icon, text character, or custom markup—which overrides the default."},{"id":"default-divider","type":"heading","en":"Default divider","level":3},{"id":"default-divider--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Leave the <code>.breadcrumb-divider</code> empty to get the built-in chevron. Customize it globally by overriding the <code>--bs-breadcrumb-divider-icon</code>, <code>--bs-breadcrumb-divider-width</code>, and <code>--bs-breadcrumb-divider-height</code> variables."},{"id":"default-divider--example-1","type":"demo","key":"31d202a9ee4141ba6fa2","height":147},{"id":"default-divider--code-1","type":"code","value":"<nav aria-label=\"breadcrumb\">\n  <ol class=\"breadcrumb\">\n    <li class=\"breadcrumb-item\">\n      <a class=\"breadcrumb-link\" href=\"#\">Home</a>\n    </li>\n    <li class=\"breadcrumb-divider\"></li>\n    <li class=\"breadcrumb-item\" aria-current=\"page\">\n      <a class=\"breadcrumb-link active\" href=\"#\">Library</a>\n    </li>\n  </ol>\n</nav>","language":""},{"id":"svg-dividers","type":"heading","en":"SVG dividers","level":3},{"id":"svg-dividers--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Add an inline SVG inside the divider to override the default with your own crisp, scalable icon. Use <code>currentColor</code> for the stroke or fill so it inherits the divider color for easy theming."},{"id":"svg-dividers--example-1","type":"demo","key":"00956447b7442a545c06","height":147},{"id":"svg-dividers--code-1","type":"code","value":"<nav aria-label=\"breadcrumb\">\n  <ol class=\"breadcrumb\">\n    <li class=\"breadcrumb-item\">\n      <a class=\"breadcrumb-link\" href=\"#\">Home</a>\n    </li>\n    <li class=\"breadcrumb-divider\">\n      <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" fill=\"currentColor\" class=\"bi\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\">\n        <path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M3.646 1.646a.5.5 0 0 1 .708 0l6 6a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .708l-6 6a.5.5 0 0 1-.708-.708L9.293 8 3.646 2.354a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.708\"/>\n        <path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M7.646 1.646a.5.5 0 0 1 .708 0l6 6a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .708l-6 6a.5.5 0 0 1-.708-.708L13.293 8 7.646 2.354a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.708\"/>\n      </svg>\n    </li>\n    <li class=\"breadcrumb-item\" aria-current=\"page\">\n      <a class=\"breadcrumb-link active\" href=\"#\">Library</a>\n    </li>\n  </ol>\n</nav>","language":""},{"id":"text-dividers","type":"heading","en":"Text dividers","level":3},{"id":"text-dividers--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"For simple text-based dividers, just add the character directly."},{"id":"text-dividers--example-1","type":"demo","key":"8a3bb25a4a72f77355ac","height":147},{"id":"text-dividers--code-1","type":"code","value":"<nav aria-label=\"breadcrumb\">\n  <ol class=\"breadcrumb\">\n    <li class=\"breadcrumb-item\">\n      <a class=\"breadcrumb-link\" href=\"#\">Home</a>\n    </li>\n    <li class=\"breadcrumb-divider\">/</li>\n    <li class=\"breadcrumb-item\">\n      <a class=\"breadcrumb-link\" href=\"#\">Library</a>\n    </li>\n    <li class=\"breadcrumb-divider\">/</li>\n    <li class=\"breadcrumb-item\" aria-current=\"page\">\n      <a class=\"breadcrumb-link active\" href=\"#\">Data</a>\n    </li>\n  </ol>\n</nav>","language":""},{"id":"custom-dividers","type":"heading","en":"Custom dividers","level":3},{"id":"custom-dividers--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Use any content you like—different icons, decorative elements, or themed separators."},{"id":"custom-dividers--example-1","type":"demo","key":"6b59a322a86d0813cc4c","height":147},{"id":"custom-dividers--code-1","type":"code","value":"<nav aria-label=\"breadcrumb\">\n  <ol class=\"breadcrumb\">\n    <li class=\"breadcrumb-item\">\n      <a class=\"breadcrumb-link\" href=\"#\">Home</a>\n    </li>\n    <li class=\"breadcrumb-divider\">›</li>\n    <li class=\"breadcrumb-item\">\n      <a class=\"breadcrumb-link\" href=\"#\">Library</a>\n    </li>\n    <li class=\"breadcrumb-divider\">›</li>\n    <li class=\"breadcrumb-item\" aria-current=\"page\">\n      <a class=\"breadcrumb-link active\" href=\"#\">Data</a>\n    </li>\n  </ol>\n</nav>","language":""},{"id":"accessibility","type":"heading","en":"Accessibility","level":2},{"id":"accessibility--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Since breadcrumbs provide navigation, it’s important to follow these practices:"},{"id":"accessibility--list-1","type":"list","tag":"ul","items":[{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"accessibility--item-1","type":"item","en":"Add <code>aria-label=&quot;breadcrumb&quot;</code> to the <code>&lt;nav&gt;</code> element to describe the navigation type"}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"accessibility--item-2","type":"item","en":"Add <code>aria-current=&quot;page&quot;</code> to the <code>.breadcrumb-item</code> containing the current page"}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"accessibility--item-3","type":"item","en":"Divider elements are automatically hidden from assistive technology via CSS"}]}]},{"id":"accessibility--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"For more information, see the <a href=\"https://www.w3.org/WAI/ARIA/apg/patterns/breadcrumb/\">ARIA Authoring Practices Guide breadcrumb pattern</a>."},{"id":"css","type":"heading","en":"CSS","level":2},{"id":"variables","type":"heading","en":"Variables","level":3},{"id":"variables--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Breadcrumbs use local CSS variables on <code>.breadcrumb</code> for real-time customization. Values for the CSS variables are generated from Sass maps unique to each component and applied to the aforementioned class."},{"id":"variables--code-1","type":"code","value":"// stylelint-disable-next-line scss/dollar-variable-default\n$breadcrumb-tokens: defaults(\n  (\n    --breadcrumb-font-size: inherit,\n    --breadcrumb-bg: transparent,\n    --breadcrumb-border-radius: var(--radius-5),\n    --breadcrumb-divider-color: var(--fg-4),\n    --breadcrumb-divider-icon: #{escape-svg(url(\"data:image/svg+xml,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 8 16'><path fill='none' stroke='black' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round' stroke-width='1.5' d='M2 2l4 6-4 6'/></svg>\"))},\n    --breadcrumb-divider-width: .375rem,\n    --breadcrumb-divider-height: .75rem,\n    --breadcrumb-link-padding-x: .75rem,\n    --breadcrumb-link-padding-y: .25rem,\n    --breadcrumb-link-color: var(--fg-3),\n    --breadcrumb-link-hover-color: var(--fg-2),\n    --breadcrumb-link-hover-bg: var(--bg-1),\n    --breadcrumb-link-active-color: var(--fg-1),\n    --breadcrumb-link-border-radius: var(--radius-7),\n  ),\n  $breadcrumb-tokens\n);","language":""}],"demos":[{"key":"64c39141da15fe215653","html":"<nav aria-label=\"breadcrumb\">\n  <ol class=\"breadcrumb\">\n    <li class=\"breadcrumb-item\">\n      <a class=\"breadcrumb-link\" href=\"#\">Home</a>\n    </li>\n    <li class=\"breadcrumb-divider\"></li>\n    <li class=\"breadcrumb-item\">\n      <a class=\"breadcrumb-link\" href=\"#\">Library</a>\n    </li>\n    <li class=\"breadcrumb-divider\"></li>\n    <li class=\"breadcrumb-item\" aria-current=\"page\">\n      <a class=\"breadcrumb-link active\" href=\"#\">Data</a>\n    </li>\n  </ol>\n</nav>\n\n<nav aria-label=\"breadcrumb\">\n  <ol class=\"breadcrumb\">\n    <li class=\"breadcrumb-item\">\n      <a class=\"breadcrumb-link\" href=\"#